  distinct_ratio is a necessary condition only. input_dependence is the raw share of within
  class feature variance lying between input programs; dependence_omega2 is the same quantity
  with the upward bias from the group count removed, and dependence_null_mean is its value when
  the program labels are shuffled. The verdict uses dependence_p, not a fixed cut, so a high
  distinct ratio with variation that does not track the input programs is caught whatever the
  group count happens to be.

